你究竟是怎么工作的？

276
00:16:05.480 --> 00:16:05.960
Yeah.
是啊。

277
00:16:06.080 --> 00:16:06.720
Oh my God.
天哪。

278
00:16:06.720 --> 00:16:08.120
You get really car sick?
你真的晕车？

279
00:16:08.400 --> 00:16:08.620
Go on.
接着说。

280
00:16:08.620 --> 00:16:10.260
Randall, I had no idea.
兰德尔，我完全不知道。

281
00:16:10.260 --> 00:16:15.240
Because when we, so many times when we filmed in cars, we just looped, we did a circle and
