283
00:16:18.460 --> 00:16:18.900
Yeah.
是啊。

284
00:16:19.260 --> 00:16:21.000
Let alone only with one eye.
更不用说还只用一只眼睛了。

285
00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:22.300
Yeah.
对。

286
00:16:22.480 --> 00:16:23.560
No, I get really car sick.
不，我真的很晕车。

287
00:16:23.700 --> 00:16:28.400
And I remember every time Chris, Chris and Ed were helping me get to get the heavy camera
我记得每次克里斯，克里斯和埃德帮我把沉重的摄像机

