290
00:16:31.100 --> 00:16:31.480
You all right?
没事吧？

291
00:16:31.640 --> 00:16:31.980
You okay?
还好吗？

292
00:16:31.980 --> 00:16:33.660
I'm like, yeah, real good.
我说，好得很，好极了。

293
00:16:34.620 --> 00:16:37.320
And I would all, you know, it lasts a couple hours, but.
而且我总是，你知道的，这会持续好几个小时，但是。

294
00:16:37.580 --> 00:16:41.620
We had, we had so many, we had so many driving scenes, Randall.
我们有，我们有太多，我们有太多的驾驶戏了，兰德尔。

295
00:16:41.820 --> 00:16:42.880
I never knew this.
我从来不知道这件事。

296
00:16:43.420 --> 00:16:43.820
Yeah.
对。

297
00:16:44.020 --> 00:16:44.860
Oh my gosh.
噢天哪。

298
00:16:45.000 --> 00:16:45.240
Yeah.
是啊。

299
00:16:45.340 --> 00:16:47.080
I was getting a little green at times back there.
我当时在后面都有点发绿了。

300
00:16:47.160 --> 00:16:47.900
I was just kind of sweating.
我直冒虚汗。

301
00:16:50.360 --> 00:16:56.400
Well, thank you because it really did produce some amazing, amazing things.
嗯，谢谢你，因为这确实带来了一些非常、非常惊艳的成果。

302
00:16:57.260 --> 00:16:58.080
That was fun.
那挺有意思的。

303
00:16:58.080 --> 00:17:05.280
I know we're sort of talking about like difficult camera positions and stuff, but Randall, you
我知道我们刚才在讨论诸如艰难的机位之类的话题，但是兰德尔，你

304
00:17:05.280 --> 00:17:06.820
