00:18:13.120 --> 00:18:13.780
the same.
不一样。

338
00:18:17.540 --> 00:18:24.800
I feel like something I want to tell our audience is how incredibly rare it is for a cinematographer
我觉得有件事我想告诉我们的观众，那就是摄影指导

339
00:18:24.800 --> 00:18:26.620
