它们如何匹配。

356
00:19:21.940 --> 00:19:24.320
And then the rest of the stuff was just worked out in poSt.
然后剩下的部分就在后期制作中解决。

357
00:19:24.480 --> 00:19:29.760
But Matt and I thought it was really important to pull our own focus and pull our own iris.
但我和马特认为，自己负责跟焦和调节光圈真的非常重要。

358
00:19:30.160 --> 00:19:35.680
I also think there's, again, a level of intimacy when the operator,
而且我也觉得，再说一次，当摄影机操作员

359
00:19:36.620 --> 00:19:39.920
