382
00:20:48.940 --> 00:20:51.780
And Randall, that's the footage that stayed in.
而兰德尔，那个镜头被保留下来了。

383
00:20:52.120 --> 00:20:52.600
Yes.
是的。

384
00:20:52.660 --> 00:20:56.080
