Well, for those of you who haven't heard what we're talking about, the whole Larry and Marjorie bit, you can go to this episode, Traveling Salesman, go to one hour,
好吧，对于那些还没听过我们在说什么的人，也就是拉里和玛乔丽的那个梗，你可以去看这一集《出差推销员》，定位到1小时

739
00:36:02.100 --> 00:36:05.760
two minutes and 20 seconds, and you will hear the whole thing.
2分20秒，就能听到整段内容了。

740
00:36:05.760 --> 00:36:11.580
All right, well, let's move on to The Return, which featured an interview with Ed HelMs.
好了，我们接下来聊《归来》，其中包含对埃德·赫尔姆斯的采访。

741
00:36:11.900 --> 00:36:12.660
So wonderful.
太棒了。

742
00:36:13.020 --> 00:36:13.820
So wonderful.
太棒了。

743
00:36:14.080 --> 00:36:23.040
A lot of people were curious why we didn't ask Ed how he came to be on The Office when we did our interview with him, because we usually lead with that.
很多人很好奇，为什么我们在采访埃德时没有问他是怎么加入《办公室》的，因为我们通常都会从这个话题开始。

744
00:36:23.400 --> 00:36:23.680
Yes.
是的。

745
00:36:23.680 --> 00:36:29.040
Well, that is because we covered Ed's origin story in The Merger.
那是因为我们在《合并》那一集里讲过埃德的背景故事。

746
00:36:29.280 --> 00:36:35.780
So if any of you missed that and you're wondering, I had interviewed Ed off air for The Merger.
所以如果有人错过了那个并且很好奇，我在录音之外采访过埃德关于《合并》的事。

747
00:36:36.140 --> 00:36:41.460
And Angela, you talked with Rashida because those were the episodes where their characters first appeared.
而且安吉拉，你和拉希达聊过，因为那是他们角色首次登场的集数。

748
00:36:41.760 --> 00:36:46.480
And I told his whole audition story in that episode, The Merger.
我在《合并》那一集里讲了他整个试镜的故事。

749
00:36:46.620 --> 00:36:48.080
So you can go back and check it out.
所以你们可以回去看一看。

750
00:36:48.200 --> 00:36:50.640
Here's a fan favorite moment we failed to mention.
这里有一个我们漏掉的粉丝最爱的时刻。

751
00:36:50.640 --> 00:36:54.200
In the episode, several people wrote in about the scene with Ryan and the lemonade.
在这一集中，有好几位观众来信提到了瑞恩和柠檬水的那个场景。

752
00:36:54.680 --> 00:37:05.940
Brianna said, if you ladies revisited season three, I wanted to say the moment in the episode at 16 minutes, 57 seconds, where Ryan draws a tilde and an accent on the lemonade.
布里安娜说，如果你们重温第三季的话，我想说一下这一集里在16分57秒的时候，瑞恩在柠檬水上画了一个波浪号和一个重音符号。

753
00:37:06.060 --> 00:37:09.700
And then his face after was probably my favorite joke of the whole show.
然后他随后的表情可能是整部剧里我最喜欢的笑点。

754
00:37:09.940 --> 00:37:11.080
Do you remember this, Jenna?
珍娜，你还记得这个吗？

755
00:37:11.200 --> 00:37:17.140
OK, so in The Return, Oscar is back from his paid vacation that he was given because of Michael's offensive behavior.
好的，所以在《归来》这一集中，奥斯卡结束了因为迈克尔的冒犯行为而获得带薪休假，回到了公司。

756
00:37:17.340 --> 00:37:20.480
And Michael is going overboard with Oscar being back.
而迈克尔对奥斯卡的回归表现得有点过头了。

757
00:37:20.640 --> 00:37:21.940
He really wants him to feel welcome.
他是真的很想让奥斯卡感到受欢迎。

758
00:37:21.940 --> 00:37:24.880
So he decides, of course, we have to throw him a party.
所以他决定，当然了，我们必须为他办一场派对。

759
00:37:25.300 --> 00:37:36.840
Michael says he wants it to be, and I'm quoting, a celebration of Oscar, an Oscar night, that he wants it to be Oscar specific and that he wants to celebrate Oscars Mexicanity.
迈克尔说他希望这是一场，我原话引述，关于奥斯卡的庆典，一个奥斯卡之夜，他希望这具有奥斯卡的特色，并希望庆祝奥斯卡的墨西哥特色。

760
00:37:37.600 --> 00:37:41.800
So at 16 minutes, 56 seconds, you see the party planning committee.
所以在16分56秒的时候，你可以看到派对策划委员会。

761
00:37:42.180 --> 00:37:45.980
They're trying to decorate the conference room using Michael's ridiculous instructions.
她们正试图根据迈克尔那些荒谬的指示来装饰会议室。

762
00:37:46.620 --> 00:37:47.420
They don't know what to do.
她们不知道该怎么办。

763
00:37:48.180 --> 00:37:56.340
Ryan is using a Sharpie and he puts a tilde over the N and an accent over the E on the big, like, you know, bottle of lemonade, the soda bottle.
瑞恩正拿着一支马克笔，在一个大大的，嗯，你知道的，柠檬水瓶子，那个汽水瓶上，在N上面加了一个波浪号，在E上面加了一个重音符号。

764
00:37:56.560 --> 00:37:56.760
Yes.
是的。

765
00:37:56.900 --> 00:37:59.280
And he looks to camera and he's like, I don't know.
然后他看着镜头，那表情好像在说，我也不知道。

766
00:37:59.400 --> 00:38:02.600
And he sets it down next to a sign that says Mexican lemonade.
接着他把它放在了一个写着“墨西哥柠檬水”的牌子旁边。

767
00:38:02.600 --> 00:38:06.660
I had completely forgotten about that moment.
我完全把这个情节给忘了。

768
00:38:06.940 --> 00:38:09.540
So, Brianna, thank you for bringing it up to the top.
所以，布里安娜，谢谢你把它重新提出来。

769
00:38:09.760 --> 00:38:17.440
A lot of people also wrote in to say that they wished we had discussed this Phyllis talking head from this episode.
还有很多人写信说，他们希望我们能讨论这一集里菲莉丝的独白镜头。

770
00:38:17.680 --> 00:38:17.940
Yes.
是的。

771
00:38:18.080 --> 00:38:19.140
Which I love.
我很喜欢那个镜头。

772
00:38:19.300 --> 00:38:20.520
And I'm bummed we didn't.
没能聊到它让我觉得很遗憾。

773
00:38:20.760 --> 00:38:27.780
This is the episode where Phyllis famously says, Dwight has a big personality and I have a big personality.
这就是那一集，菲莉丝那句名言，迪安具有强烈的人格，我也具有强烈的人格。

774
00:38:27.780 --> 00:38:32.140
And sometimes when two people like that get together, it can be explosive.
有时当两个这样的人聚在一起时，可能会擦出火花。

775
00:38:34.640 --> 00:38:35.540
So good.
太棒了。

776
00:38:35.780 --> 00:38:39.140
Our writers were so good at writing our characters.
我们的编剧太擅长塑造角色了。

777
00:38:39.440 --> 00:38:40.100
So good.
太棒了。

778
00:38:40.100 --> 00:38:46.700
But I'm telling you, I actually texted Phyllis yesterday and just told her everything that comes out of her mouth is just gold.
但我跟你说，我昨天真的给菲莉丝发了短信，告诉她她嘴里说出来的每一句话简直都是黄金。

779
00:38:47.040 --> 00:38:50.060
She is my favorite in this rewatch so far.
到目前为止，在这次重温中她是我的最爱。

780
00:38:50.220 --> 00:38:51.500
She's who I gravitate towards.
她是我最被吸引的人。

781
00:38:51.500 --> 00:38:52.920
I just love her.
我太喜欢她了。

782
00:38:52.920 --> 00:38:55.960
We recently watched Inside Out as a family.
我们全家最近看了一遍《头脑特工队》。

783
00:38:56.260 --> 00:38:56.580
Aww.
啊。

784
00:38:56.860 --> 00:39:00.320
And Phyllis is the little sad character in the girl's brain.
而菲莉丝就是那个女孩大脑里那个小小的悲伤角色。

785
00:39:00.720 --> 00:39:03.380
She is so good in that, too.
她在里面的表现也太棒了。

786
00:39:03.720 --> 00:39:05.040
She's the heart of that.
她是其中的灵魂所在。

787
00:39:05.340 --> 00:39:05.520
Yeah.
是啊。

788
00:39:05.680 --> 00:39:07.220
She made me cry in that.
她在里面把我给看哭了。

789
00:39:07.480 --> 00:39:07.640
Yeah.
对啊。

790
00:39:07.640 --> 00:39:09.320
That's like a family favorite of ours.
那可以说是我们家最喜欢的电影之一了。

791
00:39:09.560 --> 00:39:10.020
All right.
好吧。

792
00:39:10.100 --> 00:39:13.520
Well, in this episode, Dwight goes to work at Staples.
在这集中，迪安去史泰博公司上班了。

793
00:39:13.520 --> 00:39:19.140
And we had a fan catch from ElviraLyn84 that I loved.
我们收到了一个来自ElviraLyn84的粉丝发现，我很喜欢。

794
00:39:19.500 --> 00:39:30.820
At 9 minutes, 23 seconds, the woman in Staples that's talking with Dwight was played by Charlotte Stewart, who played Ms. Beetle on Little House in the Prairie.
在9分23秒时，史泰博里和迪安说话的那位女士是由夏洛特·斯图尔特扮演的，她曾在《草原小屋》里扮演过比特尔小姐。

795
00:39:30.820 --> 00:39:35.380
We also heard from Jessie M, who said she noticed this as well.
我们还收到了杰西·M的来信，她说她也注意到了这一点。

796
00:39:35.480 --> 00:39:39.200
It might be a fun fact that only an older generation can appreciate.
这可能是一个只有老一辈人才能欣赏的冷知识吧。

797
00:39:40.000 --> 00:39:45.700
Guys, during this pandemic, my family did a rewatch of Little House on the Prairie.
伙计们，在这场大流行期间，我们全家重温了《草原小屋》。

798
00:39:45.960 --> 00:39:47.540
You know, I watched it growing up.
你知道的，我从小到大都在看它。

799
00:39:47.660 --> 00:39:54.640
And my memories of Little House on the Prairie are like the baby got a fever on Christmas Eve and Paul had to go out in the rainstorm.
我对《草原小屋》的记忆就像是平安夜里婴儿发烧了，保罗不得不冒着暴风雨出门。

800
00:39:54.800 --> 00:39:57.260
And Nellie was always being mean.
而且内莉总是那么刻薄。

801
00:39:57.560 --> 00:39:58.640
And did it hold up?
而且它经受住时间的考验了吗？

802
00:39:58.640 --> 00:40:00.140
It does hold up, Ange.
确实经受住了，安吉。

803
00:40:00.240 --> 00:40:04.240
And it's a really weird thing to watch during current times.
而且在当前这个时期看，这感觉真的很奇妙。

804
00:40:04.740 --> 00:40:09.700
Because like this family, they're just on their own in their little farmhouse.
因为就像这家人一样，他们孤零零地待在自己的小农舍里。

805
00:40:09.900 --> 00:40:12.200
And the kids have to be friends with each other.
孩子们只能互相做朋友。

806
00:40:12.380 --> 00:40:15.180
And it's just the family unit.
整个家里只有他们这一家人。

807
00:40:15.360 --> 00:40:17.160
Kind of all stuck together inside.
有点像所有人都被困在屋子里。

808
00:40:17.600 --> 00:40:18.140
Yes.
没错。

809
00:40:18.400 --> 00:40:24.620
And every once in a while, Paul will venture off to town and he'll bring back some special treat.
而且每隔一段时间，保罗就会冒险去趟镇上，带回一些特别的零食。

810
00:40:24.620 --> 00:40:26.120
And it's all very exciting.
这一切都让人感到非常兴奋。

811
00:40:26.320 --> 00:40:27.820
I found that very relatable.
我发现这一点非常有共鸣。

812
00:40:28.880 --> 00:40:30.760
And I have to point out something.
而且我必须指出一件事。

813
00:40:31.040 --> 00:40:35.820
Jessie, who wrote in, her profile says she is, quote, fueled by chocolate.
来信的杰西，她的个人简介上写着，用她的话说，她是靠巧克力续命的。

814
00:40:35.860 --> 00:40:37.500
And that really made me laugh.
这真的把我逗笑了。

815
00:40:37.600 --> 00:40:38.480
Jessie, I feel you.
杰西，我懂你。

816
00:40:38.600 --> 00:40:39.400
I feel you.
我懂你。

817
00:40:39.600 --> 00:40:40.740
I saw that too.
我也看到了。

818
00:40:42.080 --> 00:40:43.540
Jessie, we're with you.
杰西，我们挺你。

819
00:40:43.680 --> 00:40:47.740
We also got a lot of mail about the Jim and Pam prank on Andy.
我们还收到了很多关于吉姆和帕姆捉弄安迪的来信。

820
00:40:48.060 --> 00:40:51.680
Now, this scene starts at 13 minutes, 24 seconds.
这个场景从13分24秒开始。

821
00:40:51.680 --> 00:40:52.920
If you want to check it out.
如果你想去看看的话。

822
00:40:53.180 --> 00:40:58.840
Jenna, if you remember, we kind of made fun, you and I, of Jim and Pam's lame spy skills, right?
珍娜，如果你还记得的话，你和我当时还取笑过吉姆和帕姆那拙劣的间谍技巧，对吧？

823
00:40:59.080 --> 00:40:59.260
Yes.
是的。

824
00:40:59.480 --> 00:41:10.360
We had said that we thought it was silly that Jim went to all the effort to sneakily steal Andy's cell phone to then just hand it off to Pam, who then moments later, you know,
我们曾说过，我们觉得很荒谬，吉姆费了那么大劲偷偷拿走安迪的手机，然后只是把它交给了帕姆，紧接着过了一会儿，你知道的，

825
00:41:10.540 --> 00:41:11.080
gets up.
她站了起来。

826
00:41:11.080 --> 00:41:14.620
And then her and Jim walk through the bullpen and she hands it back to him.
然后她和吉姆穿过开放式办公区，她又把手机还给了他。

827
00:41:14.880 --> 00:41:15.040
Right.
没错。

828
00:41:15.300 --> 00:41:15.520
Why?
为什么呢？

829
00:41:15.920 --> 00:41:17.960
Well, many people disagreed with us.
好吧，许多人不同意我们的看法。

830
00:41:18.060 --> 00:41:19.720
And they had some theories of their own.
他们有他们自己的一些理论。

831
00:41:20.120 --> 00:41:29.260
Well, Anna White said she thinks Jim gives the phone to Pam so that Pam can get Andy's cell phone number off the phone in the first place.
安娜·怀特说，她认为吉姆把手机给帕姆是为了让帕姆能从手机上弄到安迪的手机号码。

832
00:41:29.260 --> 00:41:31.160
Because how else would Jim know?
因为不然吉姆怎么会知道呢？

833
00:41:31.460 --> 00:41:38.080
She thinks Pam probably emails Jim the number so that he can start calling it after he puts it in the ceiling.
她认为帕姆可能把号码发邮件给了吉姆，这样吉姆把它藏进天花板后就可以开始给它打电话了。

834
00:41:38.540 --> 00:41:38.920
Mm hmm.
嗯哼。

835
00:41:39.400 --> 00:41:39.800
Mm hmm.
嗯哼。

836
00:41:40.060 --> 00:41:45.960
Well, my one thought is Andy is the type of guy that gave every single person his cell phone number the first day.
好吧，我的一个想法是，安迪就是那种在第一天就把自己手机号给每一个人的家伙。

837
00:41:47.280 --> 00:41:49.280
But that doesn't mean they saved it.
但这并不意味着他们保存了。

838
00:41:49.520 --> 00:41:50.320
That's true.
也对。

839
00:41:50.500 --> 00:41:50.980
That's true.
确实如此。

840
00:41:50.980 --> 00:41:55.460
But I just have this feeling that Andy has texted Jim like, what up, my dog?
但我只是觉得安迪给吉姆发过短信，比如：最近怎么样，老兄？

841
00:41:55.860 --> 00:41:56.420
Big tuna.
大金枪鱼。

842
00:41:56.720 --> 00:41:57.680
Want to meet me for a beer?
想不想和我一起去喝一杯？

843
00:41:57.840 --> 00:41:58.220
Big tuna.
大金枪鱼。

844
00:41:58.220 --> 00:41:59.560
You're going to answer big tuna.
你得回复大金枪鱼。

845
00:42:00.000 --> 00:42:02.060
Look at this crazy thing I saw on the Internet.
看看我在网上看到的这个疯狂的东西。

846
00:42:02.260 --> 00:42:02.640
Big tuna.
大金枪鱼。

847
00:42:02.900 --> 00:42:11.820
Well, I like these theories, but I think I'm going to stand by my assessment that this was a lot of effort for a prank that could have been simpler.
好吧，我喜欢这些理论，但我认为我还是要坚持我的看法，为了一个本可以更简单的恶作剧，这付出的精力实在太多了。

848
00:42:12.080 --> 00:42:13.480
It's never about the prank.
重点从来都不是恶作剧本身。

849
00:42:13.680 --> 00:42:15.560
They just wanted to spend time together.
他们只是想花时间待在一起。

850
00:42:15.980 --> 00:42:16.460
You're right.
你说的对。

851
00:42:16.720 --> 00:42:17.060
Right.
好的。

852
00:42:17.440 --> 00:42:19.600
OK, let's move on to Ben Franklin.
好，我们接着聊本·富兰克林这集。

853
00:42:20.080 --> 00:42:23.060
You guys, big Ben Franklin news.
各位，有关于本·富兰克林的大新闻。

854
00:42:23.320 --> 00:42:27.500
We found Jackie DeBotten, Elizabeth the stripper.
我们找到杰姬·德博滕了，也就是脱衣舞娘伊丽莎白。

855
00:42:27.500 --> 00:42:31.560
However, her last name is actually pronounced DeBotten.
不过，她的姓氏其实应该读作“德博滕”。

856
00:42:31.760 --> 00:42:32.840
Jackie DeBotten.
杰姬·德博滕。

857
00:42:33.340 --> 00:42:35.500
But you might remember she is in this episode.
但大家可能还记得，她不仅在这集里出现过。

858
00:42:35.660 --> 00:42:37.500
She is also in Fun Run.
她还参演了《趣味长跑》。

859
00:42:37.760 --> 00:42:40.620
And then she's going to pop up again in the finale.
而且她接下来还会在大结局里再次亮相。

860
00:42:40.800 --> 00:42:41.380
Spoiler alert.
剧透预警。

861
00:42:41.380 --> 00:42:44.480
Yes, Jackie reached out to me on DM.
没错，杰姬通过私信联系了我。

862
00:42:44.880 --> 00:42:47.000
I got her cell phone and we've been texting.
我要到了她的手机号，我们一直在发短信。

863
00:42:47.220 --> 00:42:48.020
She's so sweet.
她太温柔了。

864
00:42:48.180 --> 00:42:51.680
And she sent in some audio clips about what it was like working on the show.
她还发来了一些音频片段，讲述了当年参演这部剧的感受。

865
00:42:52.020 --> 00:42:53.240
Sam, can you play the clip?
萨姆，能放一下这段音频吗？

866
00:42:53.640 --> 00:42:54.840
Hi, Office fans.
嗨，《办公室》的粉丝们。

867
00:42:55.140 --> 00:42:56.880
It's Jackie DeBotten, a.k.a.
我是杰姬·德博滕，也就是

868
00:42:57.000 --> 00:42:58.920
Elizabeth, the stripper from The Office.
《办公室》里的脱衣舞娘伊丽莎白。

869
00:42:59.400 --> 00:43:02.600
Angela, Jenna, thank you so much for having me on your amazing podcaSt.
安吉拉、詹娜，非常感谢邀请我上你们这个棒极了的播客节目。

870
00:43:02.600 --> 00:43:08.420
I feel so honored to be here and talk about my memories from this iconic TV show.
能来到这里和大家聊聊我在这部标志性电视剧中的回忆，我感到非常荣幸。

